      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A straddling patent foramen ovale thrombus protruding into both atria and ventricles is rare. We hereby describe a case of an acutely ill young male with deep Venous Thrombosis and sub massive pulmonary embolism with a large straddling patent foramen ovale thrombus detected on echocardiography and effectively dissolved with chemical lysis."},
